# Playkeeper release signing keys, one "ed25519 <base64 public key>" per line.
#
# The release workflow signs each release's playkeeper-release.json with the
# private key in the PLAYKEEPER_RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY repository secret, and an
# installed Playkeeper only installs updates signed by a key listed here.
#
# Keys are added with `go run ./cmd/release-sign keygen` (see CONTRIBUTING.md);
# replacing one takes two releases (see SECURITY.md).
ed25519 SUalJ4HN9T/LsdzL7QcMHLkweI3WAmVsENllV7x5Y/I=
